== Key figures ==

* [[Miquel Esteve i Cardona]] — community organiser, co-organiser of the first Pride march in 1993, founder of the Sòtol Community Coalition
* [[Júlia Ballester i Masip]] — BPP member of the National Assembly (Sant Cristòfor–Dàrsena), introduced the Civil Partnership Act (2004) and advocated for marriage equality
* [[Marc Agramunt i Riera]] — plaintiff in ''Agramunt v. Balboa Pension Fund'' (2006), whose case established that civil partnerships must carry equivalent legal weight to marriage
* [[Adriana Reyes i Soler]] — transgender rights advocate, plaintiff in ''Reyes v. Ministry of Health'' (2013), whose case led to the Gender Recognition Act (2017); appointed to the Office of LGBT Affairs advisory board in 2023
